CONTROLS
--------
F1: Previous Level
F2: Next level
HELP: Replay level
ESC, Right mouse button: Quit game
S: Mode normal/Very slow (for debug)
+/-: Music Volume
P: Pause

This version is configured for Joy1, Joy0 and Keyboard (Arrows+RAlt).
(Since i didn't code menus yet, configuration is done in the code)

The last player is destined to be a computer. 
DjThunder must code computers but he doesn't know anything of my
program, so i prepared all required functionnalities to include
computer routine instead of joystick one.


